- Font: Georgia serif for body, Didot/Playfair Display for display text (logo, headings)
- All transitions: smooth 0.5s cubic-bezier(0.22, 1, 0.36, 1) easing

**Header:**
- Sticky, semi-transparent with backdrop blur
- Logo: capybara SVG mark + "CapyMart *Noir*" (Noir in italic gold)
- Tagline: "The unbothered life, after dark" (hidden on mobile)
- Cart button: gold outline, highlights on hover

**Hero Section:**
- Split layout: text left (serif headline emphasizing "relaxed" in italic gold), SVG capybara right soaking in moonlit hot spring with yuzu on head
- Smaller eyebrow text, subheading describing the dark luxury vibe
- Responsive wrapping on mobile

**Product Grid (6 items):**
- Responsive auto-fill layout (280px min), cards with gradient backgrounds
- SVG art with moody radial gradient overlays (spotlight effect + vignette)
- On hover: subtle lift (translateY -6px), gold border glow, brighter spotlight overlay
- Each card shows: product title, short description, price (gold), "Add to Cart" button
- Cards are clickable to open detail modals

**Products (all inline SVG, re-lit for noir aesthetic):**
1. Yuzu Bath Bombs ($14) — three golden citrus spheres on dark bg
2. Tiny Headphones ($32) — terracotta over-ears with gold accents
